# JS Modularization Plan

Automated scanner findings across 23 JS files (total ~10,300 lines of app code).
Scope: **only what is worth extracting** — no rewriting of working architecture.

---

## Scanner Results Summary

| File | Size | Lines | Problem |
|---|---|---|---|
| `main-app.js` | 252 KB | 5,887 | Monolith — 8 unrelated subsystems in one file |
| `app-init.js` | 227 KB | 4,292 | Monolith — 17 inline functions > 60 lines, 64 `window.X` globals |
| `ui-modules.js` | 53 KB | 1,205 | Mixed concerns — download UI + clipboard UI + metadata store |
| `file-utils.js` | 30 KB | 748 | Duplicates `escapeHtml`, `formatSpeed` already in other files |

**Critical duplicates found:**
- `escapeHtml` defined in **4** files: `file-utils.js`, `main-app.js`, `ui-modules.js`, `upload-helpers.js`
- `formatSize` defined in **2** files: `app-init.js`, `projection-layer.js`
- `cleanFolderPath` defined in **2** files: `app-init.js`, `projection-layer.js`
- `formatSpeed` defined in **2** files: `file-utils.js`, `upload-helpers.js`

