## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This plan extracts code into **new files only** — it never rewrites existing logic.
> Each extraction is a **cut + re-export** pattern, not a rewrite.
> All existing `window.X` APIs are preserved as-is so nothing breaks.

> [!WARNING]
